OL,3,ATeacher in Oregon shooting said she
OL,4,Apretended to be dead to survive
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome readers may find this article
OL,7,Fdistressing.
OL,9,FA 54-year-old teacher who survived a
OL,10,Fmass shooting at an Oregon elementary
OL,11,Fschool said she pretended to be dead so
OL,12,Fthe gunman would not shoot her again.
OL,14,FBecky Drury, a teacher at Silver Rail
OL,15,FElementary School, said in a statement
OL,16,Fshared with US media that as she tried
OL,17,Fto shut her classroom door, the gunman
OL,18,Fshot her and she fell to the floor.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
